<title>PHILIPPINES: TABLE-Philippine T-bills secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Philippine T-bills secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Monday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	 6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p> Bank of America    14.00 /13.75  14.10 /13.95  14.25 /14.10</p>
<p> BPI		    13.80 /13.50  14.25 /13.90  14.75 /14.20</p>
<p> Citibank	     13.875/13.625 14.125/13.875 14.25 /14.00</p>
<p> Hongkong Bank	14.25 /13.75  14.75 /14.25  14.375/14.875</p>
<p> PNB		    14.50 /13.75  14.75 /14.00  14.85 /14.10</p>
<p>Standard Chartered 14.00 /13.75  14.25 /14.00  14.50 /14.25</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>* To contribute to this page, please fax your quotes to Reuters Manila newsroom on (632) 817 6267. For details, please phone (632) 841 8937</p>
